  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* feat: use npm's proxy settings for npm plugins and improve download errors (#1289)\r\n* feat: use reqwest for downloading (#1291)\r\n* fix: say when the proxy is what couldn't be connected to (#1292)\r\n* fix(BREAKING/lsp): only use the global config when opted in and add global config commands (#1288)\r\n* fix: do not error for plugin config in an extended config that has no matching plugin (#1296)\r\n* fix: allow un-excluding a node_modules directory with a negated exclude (#1297)\r\n* fix: support brace expansions that span directories in file patterns (#1298)\r\n* docs: add missing plugin pages and fix Oxc sidebar label (#1293)\r\n* docs: document the global config in the vscode extension (#1285)\r\n* docs: update Oxc plugin docs for newly supported languages (#1286)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|9473b1151a872eee85b8992aaade260d71ffd8e8c2c82694804c8785a8fe99e2|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|2fb659de79f3a297c59ab3e2a8686428ba07e8910ee2f416af615ce11f018b8c|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|9a5d46a93ea87db2bb7bf9431aff10b01e83210ad37b574eecae604199a1071a|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|be61d440fec40f101a942ddd3fdf8e97b24397192f7ab9530d5f8c0ae0c9b44b|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|ed146e34d2ab6dff514114195b9c896613ac7c0b8e56f77231b1667620fb6bfd|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|87642ff4bdb0cc33dbb2032b5cd2038d1c88a2bbb7da082c515b9c32d135b10f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|d9fde88ef9e6793bbc1be395f9a4d6f3555ea1c6610d13e67a690cb664bd3373|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|a357dd71e0be40421b21f4d9bf53d505cda545973e160ecc6d95dfb3cab6948c|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|46ecd756236a1fc9895dd85479933f6f82c0264b418aa789168e0b744d1fab5a|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|ba3aff4dbd00a3d4762032e40fcb8d01ce832df9e8fc413572b61f41d3d14010|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|26a0448bb6cea0f6c3897c708d6cc6441f58ad2ab5fdd10e75529f723cac9bce|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|6bdc2b53b0ab87d3645b06c671cb38f4c79728c46b290143a7b2e9af8bac0fe6|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|204fb465779e94a8831191788e465ae9542fe7cd266b9cfc40a451a75301bc3e|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-musl.zip|5911286d2263e4f9b52fe31ef49ecc81d59ebe0910bb9122aee74fbfead86252|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-linux-android.zip|a19ae863926d35b309b945e6f61a7d32d6e66f0cf8651a8d212f6b3ecf7f0990|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-linux-android.zip|97422e54110b6fcfb8f428625712dadb8d308cf7309dd3595b12f0fb1a072442|\r\n",
